#
# NO r42.<vm_name> ENTRY HERE, AND THAT IS DELIBERATE
#
# debug_sdn_tests declares no VM of its own : it reuses an existing one, whose id is the
# sdn_test_vm_id run parameter. It never SSHes into it either - the card is moved through the
# Proxmox API, not from inside the guest. So there is no host to reach and no key to trust.
#
# The three infrastructure entries above ARE needed : the chain talks to the Proxmox API, and its
# SNAT reconciliation runs iptables on the -cli host.
#
# When this scenario gains its own VM, its `Host r42.<vm_name>` block goes here.
#
